# MKZORA + AFFINITY '26 combined project — environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env.local` in THIS folder (gitignored — never commit it). Used by `npm run preview` and `npm run audit`.
# In production set the same name as an encrypted SECRET in Cloudflare Pages
# (Settings -> Variables and Secrets), not in a file.
#
# The Google Apps Script Web App /exec URL that receives AFFINITY '26 registrations. It is used ONLY by the
# server-side proxy (functions/affinity26/api/register.js). It is never sent to the browser and never built into
# the frontend bundle. Paste the real value in .env.local, not here.
GOOGLE_APPS_SCRIPT_ENDPOINT=

# Optional: extra browser origins allowed to call the proxy (comma separated). Same-origin calls never need it.
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
